      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does car transport from Bangalore to Delhi usually take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The typical door‑to‑door transit time for a car shipped from Bangalore to Delhi is 4‑5 business days, depending on traffic on the NH‑19 corridor and weather conditions. Our live GPS tracking lets you monitor progress in real time, and we build in buffer days to protect against unexpected delays.</p>
