      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for moving a vehicle from Bangalore to Delhi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original Registration Certificate (RC), a valid insurance copy, a signed Transport Agreement, and a copy of your PAN or GSTIN for invoicing. Our team also prepares the e‑Way bill and assists with any RTO clearance forms needed at the destination, ensuring a smooth handover.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my car fully insured during the Bangalore‑to‑Delhi journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by a 100 % declared‑value, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. The policy protects against accidental damage, theft, or natural hazards while the vehicle is in our enclosed carrier. We provide the insurance certificate with the delivery invoice for your records.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading process protect my vehicle from scratches?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp is equipped with soft‑rubber rollers and a low‑angle incline that eliminates jolts. Our trained operators perform a joint inspection, place edge‑padding foam on vulnerable panels, and secure the car with a 4‑wheel lock before the ramp is lowered. This systematic approach guarantees a zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my car’s movement from Bangalore to Delhi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All of our 120+ specialized trucks are fitted with satellite GPS units that feed live location data to our customer portal. You receive a unique tracking link via email and SMS, allowing you to see real‑time progress, estimated arrival, and any scheduled stops along the route.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer any discounts for corporate or bulk vehicle shipments?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Shree Ashirwad provides tiered pricing for corporate accounts and multiple‑vehicle bookings. Discounts are applied on the base freight rate and can be combined with GST‑exempt invoicing for eligible businesses. Contact our sales team with your fleet details to receive a customized corporate quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What happens if my car arrives with damage despite the safety protocols?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">In the unlikely event of damage, our 100 % declared‑value insurance will cover repair costs up to the vehicle’s market value. We also conduct a post‑delivery inspection with you, document any issues, and file a claim on your behalf. Our commitment is to resolve any claim swiftly and transparently.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
